---
// src/pages/post/creator.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-5">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">
      BIM Software Development and Consulting
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      I'm an Licensed Architect, BIM Modeler and Full Stack BIM Software Developer with a multidisciplinary background spanning Design, Architecture, Art, Technology, Software Engineering, AI integrations and cloud-based development.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      
      
      My skill include desktop .NET applications with AI integrations, d Revit and AutoCAD API tools, full-stack web solutions using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Svelte, Astro, Bootstrap, PHP, SQL, .NET, C#, RESTful APIs, and GitHub CI/CD workflows.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      Proficient in crafting custom WPF Revit Add-ins, Dynamo scripts, custom Dynamo nodes, and parametric families to enhance BIM workflows and documentation standards. Comfortable configuring AWS environments and developing user-centric UI/UX interfaces. English proficient and Spanish native. teams.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      Skilled at bridging the gap between architecture and software, with a
      strong aptitude for innovation, technical leadership, and cross-functional
      collaboration in agile, remote teams.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
